<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    English — the source of truth. Every other locale is measured against this file by
    StringResourceParityTest; a key that exists here and nowhere else falls back to English
    silently, which is the failure mode that makes half-translated apps.

    Rules for anyone adding a key:
      * a count in a sentence goes in <plurals>, never "%d items" in a <string>. Russian,
        Polish and Ukrainian have few/many categories and "%d items" is visibly broken there.
      * unit symbols are translated too. "rpm" is "об/мин" in Russian and "U/min" in German.
      * no left/right in a key name or a value — we ship no RTL locale, but the words are also
        just wrong on a gauge.
-->
