    <!--
        Unit symbols. Translated: these are not universal — "rpm" is "об/мин" in Russian and
        "U/min" in German.

        Key names are :core:units' `UnitId.labelKey`, so the converter and the resource table
        cannot drift apart.

        The (US)/(UK) qualifier on gallons and mpg must survive translation. An imperial gallon
        is ~20% larger than a US one, so a bare "mpg" on both is a wrong number, not a vague one.
    -->
